### 1. 나의 알림 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications/my?page=0&size=10
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

### 2. 알림 읽음 처리
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications/1/read
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

### 3. 알림 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications/1
Authorization: {{accessToken}}